      "content": "It's crucial to document the sensor data thoroughly in your case notes for internal audit purposes, clearly stating the evidence contradicts the claim. You should frame the partial resolution not as an admission of fault, but as a \"customer retention gesture\" to mitigate negative feedback. This approach protects the company by logging the evidence while still offering a measured gesture to resolve the immediate conflict smoothly.",
